Template: dictator/acceleration-mode
Type: select
Choices: gpu, cpu
Default: gpu
Description: Select transcription acceleration mode:
 Dictator can use GPU acceleration (NVIDIA CUDA) for faster transcription,
 or run on CPU for broader compatibility.
 .
 GPU (CUDA):
  - Much faster transcription (5-10x speedup)
  - Requires NVIDIA GPU with CUDA support
  - Downloads ~6GB of CUDA toolkit
 .
 CPU:
  - Works on any system
  - Slower transcription
  - No additional downloads
 .
 Your hardware: ${DETECTED_GPU}
